# LLMD extension

- Language
  - Registered in @package.json
  - Highlighting borrowed from markdown → @syntaxes/llmd.tmLanguage.json
- Editor help → @src/extension.ts
  - Type @ to get files and folders, / to walk into a folder
  - Ctrl+click a file reference to open it
  - Broken reference gets a warning → @does/not/exist.go
- Parsing → @src/refs.ts, checked by @src/test.ts

```js
// @decorators inside code blocks are ignored
```